# Build from the repository root, but send only the dashboard and canonical
# ingestion implementation. Raw PDFs and durable runs are bind-mounted.
**

!contextual_retrieval_dashboard/
!contextual_retrieval_dashboard/**

!crawl_dir/
!crawl_dir/src/
!crawl_dir/src/**

contextual_retrieval_dashboard/ui/node_modules/
contextual_retrieval_dashboard/ui/dist/
contextual_retrieval_dashboard/**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
